    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d775">

                <pb facs="0900" n="804" xml:id="pg804"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">311.6124/95: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commissioner at
                        Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-07T20:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                                1921—8 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>11. Labor Department states that suggestions contained in your 304, January 19,
                    11 a.m. will be followed.</p>
                <p>Keep Department informed of any difficulties especially with regard to food.</p>
                <p>Fifty Russians were deported S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Esthonia</hi> February
                    1st routed to Riga via Libau.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
